  "Afri-Star is an ARC-bred low-chill candidate with a stated 300–500 Infruitec Chilling Unit requirement; its December–January dates were obtained at Bien Donne, Simondium, Western Cape and need local checking elsewhere. Granny Smith has an Elgin first-pick reference in late March; SAPO names Golden Delicious or Hillieri as pollen partners. These are separate cultivar references, not a continuous picking season or a warm KZN recommendation. Confirm current nursery stock and local performance.": "I-Afri-Star yindidi yobubanda obuphantsi eveliswe yi-ARC enemfuno ebhaliweyo yeeYunithi zoBanda ze-Infruitec ezingu-300–500; imihla yayo ka-Disemba–Januwari yafunyanwa eBien Donne, eSimondium, eNtshona Koloni kwaye idinga ukuhlolwa apha ekuhlaleni kwezinye iindawo. I-Granny Smith inesalathiso sokuvuna kokuqala e-Elgin ekupheleni kukaMatshi; i-SAPO ibiza i-Golden Delicious okanye i-Hillieri njengabalingane bomungu wentyatyambo. Ezi ziindidi ezizodwa zezalathiso, hayi ixesha eliqhubekayo lokuvuna okanye isincomo se-KZN eshushu. Qinisekisa ugcino lwenethsari lwangoku nokusebenza kwasekuhlaleni.",
